  "review": "<div class=\"my-6 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-900 via-orange-950 to-stone-900 text-white shadow-md flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3\">\n  <div class=\"space-y-0.5 text-center sm:text-left\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-1.5 text-amber-300 font-extrabold text-xs\">\n      <span>🍁</span><span>2026年 秋〜初冬旅行の予約速報</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-200\">\n      秋の紅葉見頃シーズンや連休の温泉宿は早期割引プランが人気です。希望の日程はお早めの空室チェックが安心です。\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F5723%2F5723.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"shrink-0 px-4 py-2 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-stone-950 font-black text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition transform hover:scale-105\">\n    ✨ 山形県 おすすめ名門ホテル・温泉旅館セレクションの空室・自慢の温泉＆空室状況をチェック →\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】山形県といえばコレ！米沢牛・山形芋煮・幻の銘酒「十四代」＆蔵王温泉・天童温泉おすすめ宿比較</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 via-emerald-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 flex items-center gap-2\">🥩 とろける米沢牛と秋の名物芋煮会！幻の日本酒「十四代」が生まれる山形</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">フルーツ王国・山形県。サクランボやラ・フランス、最高峰ブランド牛「米沢牛・山形牛」、河原で楽しむ伝統の「山形芋煮」。日本屈指のプレミア酒「十四代」や「出羽桜」。乳白色のにごり湯が湧く蔵王温泉や将棋と温泉の街・天童温泉で極上の癒やしを体験できます。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 山形県を代表する最高峰名宿</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">蔵王温泉　蔵王国際ホテル</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.75</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/5723/5723.jpg\" alt=\"蔵王温泉　蔵王国際ホテル 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 丸太造りの大浴場と100%源泉掛け流し乳白色にごり湯「八右衛門の湯」！山形牛ステーキ</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">蔵王温泉の名門リゾート。強酸性の硫黄泉露天風呂でしっとり美肌に。山形牛ステーキや芋煮汁、山形の銘酒とともに極上の東北温泉旅を満喫。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ご夫婦、シニア、にごり湯と山形牛を愛する人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>乳白色のにごり湯と極上山形牛ステーキなら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F5723%2F5723.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】蔵王温泉　蔵王国際ホテル の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">天童温泉　ほほえみの宿　滝の湯</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.55</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/53746/53746.jpg\" alt=\"天童温泉　ほほえみの宿　滝の湯 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 将棋の街・天童温泉の名門！広大な大浴場と山形味覚バイキング</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">天童温泉の中心に位置。三千坪の敷地に広がる庭園、手打ちそばの実演や山形牛、地酒カウンターが揃うバイキングが大人気。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ファミリー、三世代、グループ、天童観光と温泉を楽しみたい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>広大な大浴場と充実の山形味覚バイキングならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F53746%2F53746.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】天童温泉　ほほえみの宿　滝の湯 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white border-2 border-stone-200 shadow-md space-y-6 text-xs text-stone-800 leading-relaxed\">\n  <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-200 pb-4 gap-3\">\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-red-600 text-w